      ],
      "text": "Construct is a single Rust binary that includes a TUI, control CLI, daemon, ACP stdio server, an internal MCP bridge, and harness adapters."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_161bcf4eddb511af5b2f7ff00ae51ed2c69e4692e7f4292ab68abd5b64b771ab",
