        "slc_96494452e8e6dec1c0dd7b7b4045811b4a369f67840b09b11ed6b58d0039cdb9"
      ],
      "text": "Every session gets construct's MCP tools, letting any harness spawn subagents, send them input, and read their output for agent-to-agent orchestration."
    },
